%% ============================================================================
%% CALLOUT MESSAGES (DANGER, WARNING, NOTICE, etc.)
%% ============================================================================

\expandafter\newcommand\csname str@call.danger_read\endcsname{Please carefully read all the installation instructions before use of the multi-touch digital image dissection table for the first time.}

\expandafter\newcommand\csname str@call.info_questions\endcsname{If you have any questions, please refer to the instruction documentation of the multi-touch digital image dissection table. If further instruction or clarification is needed, please contact us.}

\expandafter\newcommand\csname str@call.notice_power\endcsname{Please ensure the power supply matches local voltage standards before connecting.}

\expandafter\newcommand\csname str@call.caution_wifi\endcsname{WiFi name must be composed of English letters. Chinese names will not be displayed.}

\expandafter\newcommand\csname str@call.warning_update\endcsname{The installation process will take some time. During this process, please do not perform any operations on the dissection table, and do not turn off the power to avoid system damage.}

\expandafter\newcommand\csname str@call.tip_password\endcsname{The password location can be found on the product label on the device (DXXX-XXXX format).}

\expandafter\newcommand\csname str@call.notice_brush\endcsname{When the brush is operated, the software will be locked and the user will not be able to use other functions in the software.}

\expandafter\newcommand\csname str@call.tip_fullscreen\endcsname{Double click on the screen or press Esc to exit full screen mode.}

\expandafter\newcommand\csname str@call.info_surge\endcsname{Taking into consideration safety, the table also comes with surge protection. In case the power is cut off during movement from horizontal to vertical, the table stays at its own place and neither goes up nor down.}

\expandafter\newcommand\csname str@call.danger_beep\endcsname{When the warning sound ``beep'' is heard, please stay away from the multi-touch digital image dissection table. Wait until the process is complete before approaching.}

\expandafter\newcommand\csname str@call.warning_rotation\endcsname{Do not continuously perform the hardware rotation. Each time the operation to switch the upright/flat function must wait for at least \textbf{5 minutes} before performing the hardware rotation again.}

\expandafter\newcommand\csname str@call.notice_safety\endcsname{Due to the safety mechanism, if the machine is operated continuously for more than 3 times in a short period of time (within 5 minutes), the dissection table will enter the ``safety protection mechanism'' and be locked for \textbf{18 minutes}. During this period, the vertical or horizontal function cannot be executed. Please wait patiently. After the mechanism is unlocked, the machine can resume rotating to the vertical or horizontal function.}

\expandafter\newcommand\csname str@call.caution_lifting\endcsname{The lifting mechanism is a shared system. When there is more than one multi-touch digital image dissection table in the same space, operating the lifting mechanism may cause all tables to perform the lifting mechanism simultaneously.}

\expandafter\newcommand\csname str@call.notice_estop\endcsname{After the emergency stop latch is pulled out, reinsert it after the emergency is removed. The upright/lying down function operation will then resume.}

\expandafter\newcommand\csname str@call.danger_carry\endcsname{\textbf{Do not carry the multi-touch digital imaging dissection table during the switch between upright and flat functions to avoid danger.} \textbf{For Safety Reason: Do not leave the table in inclined position.}}

\expandafter\newcommand\csname str@call.warning_warranty\endcsname{System damage caused by not following these precautions, abnormal behavior, or human factors will \textbf{not} be covered under warranty.}

\expandafter\newcommand\csname str@call.caution_clean\endcsname{Please do not use volatile materials, commercially available cleaners, or water to rinse and clean. This may cause damage to the screen glass, panel, or hardware circuit board. Please use the special wiping cloth for the screen to dry wipe. When not in use, please cover the table with the special dust jacket provided.}

\expandafter\newcommand\csname str@call.info_upgrade\endcsname{Taiwan Main Orthopaedic Biotechnology Co., Ltd. will upgrade the system for better performance at our own discretion.}

\expandafter\newcommand\csname str@call.warning_env\endcsname{Product damage resulting from use outside these conditions is not covered under warranty.}

